detaileddescription.para:
Owns the cross-node status API — not just health:

the _NODE_STATUS DCS-BIOS host-reporting contract (proto version, request address, message names, GATEWAY_NODE_ID, row layout NodeStatusField) — the canonical source the client's sync-a4ec.ts parses;

HeartbeatFlag + the HB_ESR_* split (HB_n flags / esr fields);

NodeHealthFlag (HEALTH_n flag bits), DIE_TEMP_UNAVAILABLE, and NodeFaultCode (the compact wire faultId dictionary the client maps to labels);

NodeKind (HEALTH_n board-kind byte — what board a NODE_ID is, announced by its firmware);

the _NODE_TELEM host contract and the TELEM_n page vocabulary (TelemPage, PduRailFlag, PduStatusFlag, the per-page field offsets, NTC_TEMP_UNAVAILABLE) — #216;
